187	/// The work an attempt was charged that no stage records: (own, shared). Since
188	/// T3 KF3 (every build stages its partial work when it stops) this is (0, 0)
189	/// on every attempt, stopped builds included; the attempt line keeps it
190	/// (RV22-1). Saturating: a stage sum above its total shows as zero here and
191	/// fails `stages_equal_totals`.
