205	/// Parity `w1_stages_equal_totals`: on every attempt, completed or stopped,
206	/// the own stages add up to the own work and the shared stages to the shared
207	/// work (the attempt's build and the verification's shared data). T3 KF3
208	/// (ROOT's ruling "KF3: main merged; K6b's parity restored in KF3") makes
209	/// every build that stops add the work its stages do not record to the stage
210	/// in progress, so the relaxation for a stopped build (ROOT's ruling on the
